<title>USA: Central and South West unit wins DOE grant.</title>
<headline>Central and South West unit wins DOE grant.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSW Communications Inc, a telecommunications unit of Central and South West Corp, said on Wednesday it had won a grant from the U.S. Department of Energy.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the grant involved developing &quot;an advanced energy management service by testing the power of personal computers and the growth of the Internet.&quot;</p>
<p>Financial terms for the 18-month project were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
